                            <p style="font-weight: normal;">Skin City is India’s largest aesthetic dermatology
                                institute, offering
                                clinical dermatology, laser treatments, cosmetic surgery, and hair restoration across 16
                                districts in Maharashtra & Karnataka. Led by Dr. Niteen Dhepe, "The Laser Man of India,"
                                Skin City has treated 5+ lakh patients with advanced skin and hair solutions. Under his
                                leadership, the institute brings together clinical expertise, advanced laser technology,
                                and personalized care to address a wide range of skin and hair concerns. From diagnosis
                                to treatment and follow-up, the team focuses on understanding each patient's needs and
                                helping them make informed decisions about their skin and hair health.</p>

